Package: RedcapLite
Type: Package
Title: A Lightweight R & REDCap Interface for Data Management
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Waiguru Muriuki <waigurusamuel@uidaho.edu>
Maintainer: Waiguru Muriuki <waigurusamuel@gmail.com>
Description: 
    RedcapLite offers a lightweight interface for interacting with 
    REDCap (Research Electronic Data Capture) via its API. The package 
    supports raw exports and optional preprocessing, including value 
    labels, checkbox handling, and column label attributes. It works 
    with longitudinal and non-longitudinal projects and can save 
    processed data in reusable formats.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
